    only carry this.\n\nksmps  = 32\nnchnls = 1\n0dbfs  = 1\n\ninstr 1\n  a0 poscil
    0.5, 220\n  out a0\nendin\n\n</CsInstruments>\n<CsScore>\nf0 z\ni1 0 -1\n</CsScore>\n</CsoundSynthesizer>\n"
  _csoundFileName: MappingTone1.csd
