  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ChannelMappingCase
  caseName: B1g
  expected: 'A mono csd on IAudioGenerator, 3D source behind the listener.

    The
    mono rule writes channel 1 into every channel of the generator''s buffer, and
    Unity''s panner sums them for a spatialized source: expect six times the level,
    the same way the MONO child does on this path.'
