    warning every couple of seconds; the\n; recording is the proof, since a sample
    that was let through would read 50.\n\nksmps  = 32\nnchnls = 2\n0dbfs  = 1\n\ninstr
    1\n  a0 poscil 50, 220\n  outs a0, a0\nendin\n\n</CsInstruments>\n<CsScore>\nf0
    z\ni1 0 -1\n</CsScore>\n</CsoundSynthesizer>\n"
  _csoundFileName: RunawayTone.csd
