  _csoundString: "<CsoundSynthesizer>\n<CsOptions>\n</CsOptions>\n<CsInstruments>\n\n;
    A parent for the CsoundUnityChild cases. It publishes two named audio channels
    and writes\n; nothing to its own output, so whatever a recording picks up came
    from a child.\n;\n;   chanA   220 Hz   0.50\n;   chanB   660 Hz   0.25\n\nksmps 
    = 32\nnchnls = 2\n0dbfs  = 1\n\ninstr 1\n  a0 poscil 0.50, 220\n  a1 poscil 0.25,
    660\n  chnset a0, \"chanA\"\n  chnset a1, \"chanB\"\nendin\n\n</CsInstruments>\n<CsScore>\nf0
    z\ni1 0 -1\n</CsScore>\n</CsoundSynthesizer>\n"
